classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ final UML: matches pawpal_system.py

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +str day_start
        +List~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_pet(name: str) Optional~Pet~
        +get_all_tasks() List~tuple~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +List~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +remove_task(title: str) bool
        +get_pending_tasks() List~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str time
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +date due_date
        +mark_complete() None
        +is_due(on: date) bool
        +next_occurrence() Optional~Task~
        +priority_score() int
    }

    class ScheduledTask {
        +str start_time
        +Pet pet
        +Task task
        +str reason
        +end_time() str
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +date today
        +List~ScheduledTask~ plan
        +List~tuple~ skipped
        +get_pending_tasks() List~tuple~
        +sort_tasks(pairs) List~tuple~
        +sort_by_time(pairs) List~tuple~
        +filter_tasks(pet_name, completed) List~tuple~
        +detect_conflicts() List~str~
        +build_daily_plan() List~ScheduledTask~
        +complete_task(pet_name: str, title: str) Optional~Task~
        +explain_plan() str
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" *-- "*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : reads tasks via get_all_tasks()
    Scheduler "1" *-- "*" ScheduledTask : builds plan of
    ScheduledTask --> Pet : for
    ScheduledTask --> Task : schedules
    Task ..> Task : next_occurrence() creates